  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "TYMKRS: The White Rabbit is a homebrew NES game that was made as a Christmas present to the Tymkrs. A second copy was made as a gift for the annual White Elephant gift exchange event for the hackerspace the Tymkrs hosts, &quot;The Rabbit Hole&quot;. As a celebration of that hackerspace, the project utilized The Rabbit Hole name and logo."
    }
